window.products.push({"id":260103,"name":"3 in 1 Sleeper Sofa Couch Bed, Small Tufted Velvet Convertible Loveseat Futon Sofa w/Pullout Bed, Adjustable Backrest, Cylinder Pillows, Multi-Pockets","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":329.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OM3nuCKcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description: Stretch out and relax on this handsome sofa bed. Modern tufted velvet sofa bed features iron frame hinges and a sturdy wood frame so it will last a long time. Its vibrant velvet upholstery is a jewel tone that is simply stunning and adds a splash of color to your life. The back cushions are plump and padded with quality materials to keep you rocking in comfort, and it comes with two cylinder pillows to help you prop up and relax. Specification: Upholstery Material: Velvet Frame Material: Solid + Metal + Manufactured Wood Leg Material: Plastic Seat Construction: Sponge Back Fill Material: Polyester+Foam Pillows Included: Yes(2 Pillows) Weight Capacity: 250lbs/seat Dimension: Overall Size: 55.5\"W*38.5\"D*30.5\"H Seat Size: 48\"W*21.5\"D Sleeper Size: 70\"D*46\"W Back Height: 15.5\" Arm Height: 24\" Seat Height: 17\" Leg Height: 2\" Features: Adjustable pull-out sofa bed: By pulling out the bed frame under the seat, this double-position sofa can be quickly converted into a bed for resting use. Adjustable and super strong: soft high-grain velvet fabric and high-density foam,  it can be used for listening, playing games, reading, and sleeping. It will make you feel relaxed and comfortable. Perfect function: Pulling out the bed frame can quickly turn the sofa into a bed. Pull-out with a bed made of high-quality foam and a metal iron frame can steadily support you to lie on the bed. Multi side pockets: The multi side storage bag are designed for to storing your TV remote, cell phone, glasses, or books. Small items within easy reach. Also includes two soft pillows for added back support or sleep.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OM3nuCKcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Antetek","source_asin":"B0C627V8VR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-260103","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C627V8VR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C627V8VR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":260104,"name":"White Faux Taxidermy The Templeton White Faux Deer Wall Sculpture (Antique White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":174.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YrV6NjFlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"*Deer Head Specs* Large Size: 15.75W x 20.5H x 12.75D (in.) Approx. 6lbs. Artisan-crafted modern farmhouse deer decor in hand-painted eggshell resin with eggshell antlers. Bespoke contemporary rustic animal wall art by White Faux Taxidermy.) *Unique Exclusivity* Handpainted by a professional artist in Cincinnati, Ohio. Enjoy the individual subtleties and slight variations of this chic deer art, as is the beauty and charm of handcrafted goods. *Priceless Peace of Mind* Harmless faux taxidermy, designed and individually hand-painted in the USA (from domestic and global components) making each chic deer sculpture a unique piece of wall decor. *Hassle-Free Hanging* This eclectic deer head & antler decor is crafted from a fairly lightweight polyresin material that hangs on a household nail, screw, or hook from the keyhole slot on the back of the sculpture. NOTE: the stag antlers are removable to save space in shipping; secure them in place with a bit of super glue before hanging. *Versatile & Low-Maintenance* Artistic satin finish on eggshell-painted resin, suitable as bedroom, office, living room, kitchen, or nursery decor. Wipe with soft/clean cotton cloth, using warm water & mild hand/dish soap if needed for easy cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YrV6NjFlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"White Faux Taxidermy","source_asin":"B07N96NGP3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-260104","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N96NGP3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N96NGP3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":260105,"name":"SOFTSEA 10 inch Cooling Gel Memory Foam Mattress, CertiPUR-US Foam,Medium Comfort Feel, Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zVnslPE8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What is Gel Memory Foam?Gel memory foam mattresses are made by either adding gel beads (capsules filled with gel) to memory foam, swirling liquid gel into memory foam, or adding gel on top of the comfort layer. Cooling gel helps in dissipating heat, allowing you to sleep cool while retaining memory foam’s original body-conforming and pressure-relieving features.Why Choose Gel Memory Foam? - From A BuyerThings have come a long way since the introduction of traditional memory foam, and, in my experience, cool memory foam mattresses utilizing gel properties helped me stay significantly cooler. They also typically incorporate a combination of additional layers to help prevent you from sinking in too far, thus feeling stuck.Product DetailsComfort Level: MediumMattress Type: Gel Memory FoamMattress Top Type: Tight topMattress overall size: 60\" x 80\" x 10\"Mattress Overall Product Weight: 56 PoundsNumber of Layers: 3Mattress Thickness: 10\"（2\" gel memory foam + 2\" Pressure Relief Comfort Foam + 6\" high-density support foam )Cover Material: Premium three-dimensional KnitCertifications: CertiPUR-US CertifiedCountry of Origin: Malaysia","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zVnslPE8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOFTSEA","source_asin":"B08QCLVRXJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-260105","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QCLVRXJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QCLVRXJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":260106,"name":"Personalized Cruise Ship Ornament 2022 – Polyresin Cruise Ship Couple Christmas Ornaments – Travel Ornaments – Unique Travel Gifts for Couples – Cruis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714DcIX+LBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality Travel Christmas Ornaments – Unlike other Holiday décor that breaks and falls apart in a matter of weeks. Our cruise ship Christmas ornament is durable and lightweight for lasting quality and easy hanging on the family tree for a special twinkle in your ornament tree décor! Vibrant colors and elegant details of a sweet couple on a cruise ship. This Holiday season, celebrate your special moments together and make every vacation memorable with this special cruise ornament 2022! Expert Artist Personalization – Other personalized Christmas vacation ornaments often arrive with messy, clumsy personalization (or worse, the wrong name). Our talented in-house artists handwrite each personalization to your exact specifications using custom paint pens imported from Germany. Every adventure ornament is delicately hand painted to ensure its unique appearance for a ONE-OF-A-KIND customized ornament for couples and around the world ornaments you’ll always cherish. Celebrate Life’s Biggest Moments – Cherish your favorite memories and commemorate those incredible vacations and special moments spent with your loved ones that you want to remember most. Crafted with festive details and vibrant colors and personalized to your specifications, your unique cruise ship vacations ornament and travel decorations will make your Christmas decorations tree feel extra special and unique to your family home. This season, give the gift of joy! 24-Hour Order Processing – Our travel ornaments for Christmas tree make beautiful cruise ship party decorations, travel theme engagement party decor and gifts for travelers to cherish every Holiday season. Your miniature cruise ship tree ornament will arrive ready for gifting, nestled in tissue paper with a Gift Box, Gift Bag and Gift Tag – no need for wrapping! The perfect gifts for travel lovers and cruise ship enthusiasts to create lasting memories that will surely be cherished forever! Happy Couples – At Holiday Traditions, we’re dedicated to crafting beautiful anniversary, newlywed ornament travel themed gifts for couples to celebrate the holidays – and their love for each other. Having been in business for over 17 years, creating and personalizing over 640,000 custom tree ornaments along the way, we’re experts in quality craftsmanship. If for any reason you don’t love your couple cruise themed decorations 2022, please reach out to us directly so we can make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714DcIX+LBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holiday Traditions","source_asin":"B07GBMPWYS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-260106","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GBMPWYS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GBMPWYS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
