window.products.push({"id":260185,"name":"Ausic Handheld Fan Misting Fan, Small Portable Fan, 40ml Mister Fan, Foldable Hand Held Fan Battery Operated Fan Rechargeable, 3 Speed Powerful USB Fa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Lt6-YLC3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💦【Cooler than Cooler】: In hot summer, ordinary fans no longer satisfy you. Most portable fan are just for cooling, leaving you dry and uncomfortable. Mister fan is ideal, meet your dual needs, bringing you double the coolness. 💦【2 IN 1 Cooling Fan】: With 40ml water tank, the misting fan can spray about 2.5 Hours after filled with water. The misting duration are 3 times longer than other misting handheld fan, included a 50ml bottle, convenient add water outdoor. 💦【Powerful Cooling & Three Speeds】: The upgraded motor makes the top speed up to 4200rpm, easily relieve hot flashes in 3 seconds. 6-blade design, generate stronger airflow than other blades and rotate faster. USB fan built-in real 3000mAh battery, running for 3-11 hours (depending on wind speed). 💦【Portability & Compact】: The small fan only 0.42 lb, can be rotated 180°, extending to be a hand held fan, collapsing to be a desk fan and easy storage(Folded size: 3.94×4.33 inch). Equipped with pinch clip, it can be a clip on fan. Included a lanyard, personal fan can be hanged on your wrist, easy to carry out. 💦【Summer Companion】: The travel fan compatible with all USB output devices, pocket size makes it easy to stuff into bag to take anywhere. Great choice for indoor and outdoor activities, such as hiking, camping, shopping, traveling, working. Take a mini fan wherever you go, so you will not get sweaty and irritated. 💦【Notice】: ➊Ultra-fine misting design will not affect your makeup and hair. ➋The outdoor misting fan has a protection mechanism, the spray automatically turn off every 30 minutes. You need to press and hold for 2 seconds to turn on the spray mode.☻Kindly note: It will be cooler with ice water!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Lt6-YLC3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ausic","source_asin":"B0C3GYTG47","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-260185","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3GYTG47","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3GYTG47","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
