window.products.push({"id":260253,"name":"Saeco Classico Stainless Steel Espresso and Cappuccino Machine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41W5FW17YAL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Be a proud owner of this high-end espresso coffee machine that combines all the key elements of a true espresso machine with a sleek and elegant stainless steel body. Not only will it look great on your counter, it also epitomizes SaecoÆs top quality products to make mouthwatering espressos, cappuccinos and lattes. Featuring a 15-bar pump, a pod adaptable pressurized filter holder for use with ground coffee or pods, a cup warming surface, an exclusive pannarello milk frothing device and a removable 80 oz water tank. Extra Value Bonus Starter Kit comes - 12 Espresso pods, 1 hard cover ôEspresso, Cappuccino & Coö book, 2 white espresso cups and saucers and an instruction video. Amazon.com All it takes is a push of a button to brew one or two cups of espresso with this traditional pump-driven, made-in-Italy machine. A hot water/steam wand with a milk-frothing attachment then converts the espresso into a cappuccino or latte. For convenience, the filter holder accepts either ground coffee or preground coffee pods, and the 1,250-watt machine requires no waiting time between brewing and frothing. Clad in handsome, satin-finish stainless steel, the machine is a compact 11-3/4 inches high, 8 inches wide, and 9-1/4 inches deep and weighs 17 pounds. It has a removable, transparent, 86-ounce water tank and heated cup storage on the top. Cleaning the removable parts requires nothing more than soaking in soapy water, rinsing, and drying, and the exterior cleans with a damp cloth. Included with the machine, which carries a 1-year warranty against defects, is a starter kit with 2 espresso cups and saucers, 12 espresso pods, an instruction video, and a coffee-lore book. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41W5FW17YAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Saeco","source_asin":"B00005LVWP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-260253","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005LVWP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005LVWP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":260254,"name":"Ventidora 100% Washed Cotton Sheet 4 Piece Bedding Set Green Twin Size,Ultra Soft Breathable 100% Natural Cotton Duvet Cover Set with Corner Ties(1Duv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kbV+TF+qS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ღ.PREMIUM SHEET 4 PIECE BEDDING SET BENEFITS：Our 4 Piece Duvet Cover Set-1 Duvet Cover(68x90Inches)1 Flat Sheet(66x96Inches)&2 Pillowcases(20x28Inches),Not Include Duvet Insert.100% washed cotton choose cotton as the material to make the quilt cover more breathable-make sure you feel warm in cold weather and cool in warm weather,Absorb moisture to create a dry sleeping environment all night,unlike regular fabrics that make you sweat.Provides a comfortable and breathable sleep experience. ღ.PROCESS TECHNOLOGY：Washing cotton is a kind of production process.After the fabric is specially treated,the surface of the fabric will have a softer tone and luster,a softer and more comfortable feel the utility model has the advantages of non-sultry,dry and breathable when used,non-deformation when washing,non-fading and non-ironing.And the texture of old materials is reflected in the slight folds. ღ.EASY TO CARE:Machine Washable.No ironing required.After each wash,The comfortable and breathable duvet cover will become softer. Washed cotton fabrics are characterized by high strength and durability.Resistant to shrinkage,fading and tearing,strong enough to withstand frequent washer and dryer cycles.No need to deliberately take care of Cotton Bed Sheet Set. ღ.FOCUS ON DETAILS:Our pillowcase has a unique straight-tube closure for easy insertion and removal from the cover,and the duvet cover has a zipper design,the utility model has 8 Corner ties to keep your duvet insert or comforter in place.However,our Flat Sheets are not as cumbersome as a fitted sheet and can be easily laid on the mattress won't move easily.No matter which kind of mattress you use, it is suitable,you don’t need to worry about the model. ღ.Guarantee:we always follow the principle of customer first,do a good job in each product,If you have any questions,please feel free to contact us,our customer service staff will reply you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kbV+TF+qS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ventidora","source_asin":"B092QGRJJK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-260254","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092QGRJJK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092QGRJJK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
