window.products.push({"id":260295,"name":"Cangshan Z Series 62526 German Steel Forged Serrated Utility Knife, 5-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715mT1KULdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hand crafted full tang knives forged from tight grained, X50CrMoV15 German Steel for incredible durability, stain resistance and exceptional edge retention. 2019 Houseware Design Award Winner. USPTO Patented Design. Each blade goes through an (ultra6) stage heat treatment ensuring every blade maintains it strength and function. Hand sharpened to a 16-degree angle per side. HRC 58 +/- 2 on the Rockwell Hardness Scale. Well balanced 5\" handle and 5\" serrated edge blade with HRC 58 +/- 2 on the Rockwell Hardness Scale. This utility knife features a serrated blade that's ideal for everything from delicate tomatoes to salami and crusty breads—without tearing or compressing soft interiors. NSF International Certified. Lifetime Warranty against manufacturer defects. Wash knives with warm water and a little detergent, rinse carefully and dry with a towel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715mT1KULdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cangshan","source_asin":"B01NCR8JQ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-260295","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NCR8JQ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NCR8JQ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":260296,"name":"Plastic Butter Dish with Lid - Butter Keeper with Knife, Seal Design Butter Dish with Knife, Cute Head Design Butter Cutter Box, Small Butter Containe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xjrFZdZGS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SEAL DESIGN & MORE HEALTHIER : Butter Dish With Knife, are you distressed about the butter is not fresh? Our innovative designed silicone sealed butter dish is the perfect dish to keep your butter fresher longer. Seal butter dishes keeps butter cool and fresh better. BUTTER DISH SET : Butter Dish With Lid, Butter is the real and healthier deal but that foil wrap it comes in is a nuisance. This covered butter dish with lid is designed for safe butter storage, convenience, and easy cleaning, all with special design. BETTER TASTING BUTTER : Butter dish with lid for countertop, There are several reasons why a seal design butter dish with lid is better. Sealing makes butter not easy to oxidize. It guards against dust particles, insects, and bacteria in the air, while maintaining freshness longer and more effectively than other. EASY TO CUT BUTTER : Butter dish with knife and lid, Scoop ramps design, Curved ramps at both ends of the plastic butter dish help you easily scoop up butter; Just slide your knife up the ramp; No more chasing butter squares around the tray; And the top of the ramps act as scrape plates to clean your knife and organize butter easier. BEST BUTTER DISH PLASTIC FOR YOU : Butter dish with lid and steel knife, Our butter dish with cover is food safe, BPA free, dishwasher safe, seal. Butter dish has a clean, contemporary style that fits in any kitchen; Compact, light, plastic, and easy to carry with soft Anti-slip stickers so it’s not clunky or loud.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xjrFZdZGS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Health-Made","source_asin":"B093SZRWPK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-260296","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093SZRWPK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093SZRWPK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
