window.products.push({"id":260360,"name":"Portable Air Conditioners, 14000 BTU(Ashrae) /10400 BTU (SACC),Cooling,Dehumidifier,Fan Mode,WiFi Smart Control,Up to 600 Sq. Ft","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":399.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zwxbwaZGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔【4 IN 1 & MORE COMFORT】The portable air conditioner adopts simple electric plug operation and has four modes: Cooling,Dehumidifier,Fan,Sleep Mode.You can not only feel the cooling effect of portable air conditioner, but also avoid dry skin and keep clean skin by maintaining humidity! ✔【WIFI CONTROL FROM ANYWHERE】 You can start or stop cooling, change the mode, or set the temperature anytime, from anywhere with DuraComfort App. ✔【ENERGY EFFICIENT】By optimizing the configuration, make the mobile air conditioner is more efficient and energy-saving, quickly bring coolness to the whole house after turning on! The 90° wide-angle automatic swing wind is equipped with three wind speeds, so you can control it as you like! This is a mobile air conditioner specially designed for apartments, rental houses, and kitchens! ✔【QUIETER SLEEP MODE】The portable air conditioner adopts advanced noise reduction technology and has a 24-hour timing. It will emit a delicate and gentle wind, accompany you to sleep peacefully! Blow away the heat in summer and maintain a cool and relaxing living environment.let warmth cover the whole house. ✔【EASY INSTALLATION】Portable air conditioner has passed UL and FCC certification.Different from the traditional air conditioner, its integrated design eliminates the trouble of installation.You can move it to any position you want.Providing you with comfortable cool temperature whenever and wherever you need! ✔【UP TO 600 SQ. FT】 Our 10,400 BTU SACC/CEC (14,000 BTU ASHRAE) compact air conditioner will keep you cool in the summer and warm in the winter. ✔【ALL WINDOW KITS INCLUDED】 Our portable air conditioner comes with all the materials you need, Includes exhaust hose, window panels, exhaust hose/window frame couplers, etc.So no additional assembly tools are required. And thanks to the fast connector humanized design,you can easily and successfully install it. It’s also easy to move around into any room with handles & 4 x 360° castor wheels.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zwxbwaZGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DuraComfort","source_asin":"B09YMK2JQ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-260360","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YMK2JQ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YMK2JQ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
