window.products.push({"id":260499,"name":"EnHomee Pink Dresser for Bedroom with 12 Drawers, Tall Dressers for Girls Bedroom with Wood Top Metal Frame, Dresser & Chest of Drawers for Bedroom, C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91cqlq9iM3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Try Something Different with This Cute Tall Dresser. Quality pink fabric drawers combine with sturdy pink wooden top, these gives this kids dresser for bedroom a comfortable and stylish taste. Manage all season clothes with this chest of drawers in closets or bedroom, use it as nursery dresser to stock diapers or powdered milk, load sundries close to doors or near the entryway, or prepare towels and spare slippers for guests. 12 Drawer Dresser For Bedroom with Large and Versatile Storage. EnHomee nursery dresser sizes 40.5\"W x 11.8\"D x 43.7\"H has 8 large and 4 medium drawers, this pink dresser for girls bedroom provides a large amount of storage space. All drawers hold 53 socks, 43 shirts, 15 diapers, 8 pants, 6 hoodies in total for your reference. Easily manage tons of items with this girls dresser as each drawer has a 13 lbs load capacity. Stronger and larger drawers, for more storage options. Fabric Drawer Dresser Built with High Quality. All drawers of this dresser for bedroom are made of wear-resisting, long-lasting color fabric, no more worry about scratches, safe and reliable. Made of durable metal frame, this bedroom dresser with two X shape lacing bars ensures a longer service life. A heavy duty wooden top combines with the metal structure, prevents this dresser & chest of drawers from shaking or wobbling. Safe and Reliable Quality for All Age Use. 4 adjustable feet protects your floor from scratches and makes this storage dresser level placed. Make sure to install anti-tipping kit so that this cloth dresser will not fall down and wobble, this ensures a safe use for toddlers and kids. No worry about any smell, this chest of drawers chooses fine quality fabric. Easy use, safe and reliable. Easy Assembly and Sweet Service. Easy to assemble with tools and detailed instructions already included in the box within just 30 minutes. Enhomee provides an one-year all-round warranty for this pink dresser, we will answer every issues and inquiries within 24 hours, contact us at anytime and you will get satisfactory answers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91cqlq9iM3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EnHomee","source_asin":"B0B6YSNBQ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-260499","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6YSNBQ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6YSNBQ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":260500,"name":"Tencel Sheets Full-100% Eucalyptus Tencel Lyocell Sheets Sets-All-Season Eucalyptus Sheets-4 Piece Full Size Tencel Sheets-Best Cooling-Supersoft-Mois","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":72.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HTcKS9cJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"♥ 100% Eucalyptus Tencel Lyocell Sheet Set ♥ Imported ♥ TENCEL LYOCELL 4 PIECE SHEETS FULL SIZE INCLUDES: The Tencel Lyocell Full size sheets Include one Full Bed Flat Sheet Size: 81” x 96”; One Fully Elasticized Fitted sheet with deep pockets: 54” x 75” + 15”; 2 Standard Pillowcases: 20” x 30”. The Tencel Lyocell Full size Sheet Set & standard Pillowcases have a stylish 4-inch Hem detailing for a sophisticated look. The Tencel Lyocell full sheets are hygienic because of Tencel Lyocell fibers and provide you with comfortable sleep. ♥ FULL SIZE Tencel Lyocell SHEETS BENEFITS: 100% Eucalyptus Tencel Lyocell from Austria, sourced from forests certified by Tencel Lyocell and the Forest Stewardship Council and PEFC. Tencel Lyocell provides exceptional temperature regulation and moisture-wicking. It absorbs 70% more moisture than cotton in a controlled manner and then quickly releases it to provide the perfect dry sleeping environment. Sleep better and wake up each morning feeling refreshed and full of energy. ♥ PERFECT SNUG FIT: Cottington Lane 100% Eucalyptus Tencel Lyocell 15\" deep pocket full sheets have been stitched using premium quality rip-resistant elastic, which aids in perfect snug fitting to mattresses with 9\" to 15\" thickness. These full size Tencel Lyocell bed sheets and Pillowcases have a stylish Hem detailing across the border. ♥ FABRIC COOLNESS: Tencel Lyocell Full bed sheets are known for their sweat-wicking and cooling properties. These temperature balancing Tencel Lyocell fibers sheets keep you cool and moisture-free during summer and warm and cozy during winters. ♥ EASY CARE: Cottington Lane Eucalyptus Tencel Lyocell bedding is softer than silk and cooler than linen. It also has a luxurious sheen. It's so easy to care for: gentle machine washes and tumbles dry on low steam if preferred. It actually gets softer the more you wash it and it also does not pill as fast as cotton.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HTcKS9cJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cottington Lane","source_asin":"B09HRR8MMD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-260500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HRR8MMD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HRR8MMD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
