window.products.push({"id":260533,"name":"Essentra Home Matte Black Soap Dispenser with Chrome Pump for Bathroom, Bedroom or Kitchen. Also Great for Hand Lotion and Essential Oils.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Kk8Fa+qFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MODERN DESIGN: This soap/lotion dispenser features a simplistic modern design combined with the satin matte black which adds color neutrality that will compliment most home décor themes QUALITY MATERIALS: To complement its simplicity, this dispenser is made from a high quality polyresin, giving it a strong and elegant finish FEATURES: This matte black soap dispenser features a chrome plastic pump for a firm and smooth feel when pumping. MULTI-PURPOSE: Use this dispenser in your bedroom and bathroom as your lotion or soap dispenser. You can also use it in your kitchen as a soap dispenser. DESIGN AND QUALITY: With its satin matte black design, the high-quality materials used and versatility offered, this is definitely a must in your household.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Kk8Fa+qFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Essentra Home","source_asin":"B07GSN797K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-260533","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GSN797K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GSN797K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":260534,"name":"Calphalon Kitchen Essentials 7-Piece Ceramic Bake Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/416ABG7NCTL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description You'll be well equipped to prepare almost anything in the kitchen with this Kitchen Essentials® from Calphalon® Ceramic Bakeware Set. The 7-pc. set of fine glazed stoneware includes a 9x13 rectangular baker, 8x8 square baker, 9\" deep-dish pie plate and 4 ramekins. Stoneware provides gentle, even heating—ideal for casseroles, baked pasta dishes and more. The attractive white interior with sleek matte gray enameled exterior gives the pieces oven-to-table versatility and beauty. Dishwasher- and microwave safe. Also freezer safe for convenient food storage. Makes a wonderful wedding gift! Imported. Amazon.com The Calphalon brand name is synonymous with anodized aluminum cookware, so some might be surprised to see the company make a foray into ceramic bakeware. This 7-piece set includes a 9-by-13-inch rectangular baker for lasagne or shortbread, an 8-by-8-inch square baker for fruit crumbles or smaller casseroles, a 9-inch-diameter deep pie dish for pies and cakes, and four ramekins for individual custards or pot pies. As with the high-quality materials used to make its cookware, Calphalon has chosen the finest glazed stoneware for its bakeware line. The stoneware heats evenly and gently so meals or desserts baked in these baking dishes turn out perfect every time. An attractive gray exterior makes these baking dishes presentable enough to serve at the table after baking and the smooth white interior resists stains and releases food easily. These dishes can withstand oven and broiler temperatures up to 500 degrees Fahrenheit and can go in the freezer to store casseroles for baking later. All Kitchen Essentials ceramics are dishwasher- and microwave-safe and are covered by a 10-year warranty. --Cristina Vaamonde What's in the Box 9-by-13-inch baker; 8-by-8-inch baker; 9-inch deep pie plate; four 3-1/2-inch ramekins","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/416ABG7NCTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calphalon","source_asin":"B00008GW9H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-260534","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00008GW9H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00008GW9H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
