window.products.push({"id":260560,"name":"Valentine Snow Globe Lantern, Snowman Family Vintage Christmas Snow Globes Musical,Christmas Lanterns with Water Swirling Glitter, USB & Battery Opera","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812y-PuEvPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Snow Globes Christmas with Music: The musical Christmas snow globe lantern will cycle play 8 Christmas themed songs, while the swirling glitter water in the Christmas snow globe lantern flows with the music. The light up Christmas snow globe lantern emits a warm white light, enhancing the Christmas atmosphere Unique Design: The Christmas snow globes musical uses a retro lantern design, a happy snowman family and tree are built into the Christmas snow globe lantern, when the Christmas music is played, it looks like a family singing. There is a ring on the top of the Christmas lanterns, which can be easily held or hung Automatic Timer: Christmas snow globe lantern with music has a switch, three control modes: light up with music/off/only light up. When the musical Christmas snow globe lantern work for 6 hours and automatically turn off, cycle every 24 hours automatically. The timing function can effectively protect the Christmas musical snow globe lantern to avoid accidents during long hours of work Two Power Supply Methods: The Christmas snow globe lantern can be powered by USB to DC cable(include) and 3AA batteries(not include), the battery allows the vintage Christmas snow globes to be used more freely. Note: The automatic timer is only available when the battery is in use, and the battery and USB cannot be used to operate the musical snow globe Christmas lantern at the same time Christmas Decoration & Gift Choice: This Christmas snow globe lantern is made by hand, and the exquisite lines and carvings make the snowman vivid, so the lantern snow globes Christmas with music can be used not only as a Christmas decoration, but also as Christmas gifts for family and friends. This vintage Christmas snow globes can also be used as children’s collection and as a good night song player for children at night","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812y-PuEvPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Taowon","source_asin":"B09JVZSDF4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-260560","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JVZSDF4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JVZSDF4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
