window.products.push({"id":260571,"name":"Night & Day Murphy Cube Queen Cabinet Bed Professionally Assembled by SDS Cabinet Beds with Custom 6\" Memory Foam Mattress (White Finish)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1797.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kWdjFkpjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Murphy Cube Cabinet Bed collection is Night & Days best selling cabinet bed line due to its exceptional value, clever design, and solid wood construction. Add the convenience of pre-assembly and the satisfaction of knowing you will receive a fully assembled cabinet bed prepared by a vendor with the experience of thousands of assembled beds and you have the best guest bed solution you can get. Night & Day has considered every aspect of this cabinet bed. Applying years of furniture manufacturing experience, design aspects from premium cabinet beds, and consumer needs they have refined the Cube Cabinet Bed into the value minded guest bed solution it is today. Just a few of the unique features are: It’s simple design allows it to convert from a chest to a bed in under a minute. It has a weight limit of 500 pounds total (250 pounds per person with a two person limit to the bed). The sleep enclosure is completely open and the height of the mattress from the floor is 17.5 inches allowing easy access for your guests. Its size allows it to be moved and no permanent installation is required. SDS has partnered with Night & Day to offer the Cube Cabinet Bed with no customer assembly required in its original four finishes (Cherry, Dark Chocolate, White, and Stonewash) and now three limited run, exclusive to SDS, finishes (Antique White, Rustic Gray, and Black Walnut). There are many guest bed options on the market today but the Cube Cabinet Bed offers the most value and flexibility without compromising on comfort or functionality. Don’t spend thousands on a traditional murphy bed that has to be permanently installed or deal with other cabinet beds that are poorly designed and made from particle board. We understand purchasing furniture online can be difficult. If you have questions or concerns about delivery please contact us prior to purchase. We will work to find the best solution for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kWdjFkpjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Night & Day","source_asin":"B07HKRQNGW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-260571","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HKRQNGW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HKRQNGW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
