window.products.push({"id":260574,"name":"USILAND Handmade Holiday Gnome Wood Sign Nordic Hat Gnomlin Home Decorations, 13.5 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813TGdo8cKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LUCKY GNOME: Gnome, which is also called Tomte, or Nisse. Gnomes are mythological creature from Scandinavian folklore, often bring good luck & reward their household with love and happiness! They are believed to be household spirits and responsible for the care & prosperity of the family. They are a special addition to any home, decor, or season. It is the most thoughtful gift! HANDMADE GNOME: Each Gnome is individually handmade. Here are various different styles to meet your demands of Halloween decoration. Pick them and begin your gnome collection! (NOTE: Gnomes are designed for home decor, do not play as toys as they contain small parts that are choking hazards for small children!) UNIQUE APPEARANCE: These rustic wooden table decors are full of Halloween atmospheres, such as spiders, pumpkins, witches’ cauldrons, and other Halloween elements. Suitable for dressing up your living room, bedroom, kitchen, garden, and office during the hold Halloween. SIZE & MATERIAL: About 13.5 inches tall, 5.5 inches wide. Gnome’s body is made of premium wood, which is durable and sturdy, and the stable base makes these wooden gnomes stand on the table firmly. The fiber fur long beard and globular nose are accords with his traditional appearance traits. His head decoration includes a wire, and you can pose it any way you like. HOLIDAY GIFTS: The adorable gnome will be a unique gift for anyone at the Halloween holiday party. They are a perfect addition to your fall and Halloween decor and just the right size for any nook in your house such as a table, fireplace, shelf, and so on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813TGdo8cKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"USILAND","source_asin":"B095VLKKT6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-260574","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095VLKKT6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095VLKKT6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
