window.products.push({"id":260737,"name":"Utopia Bedding Duvet Cover Twin Size Set - 1 Duvet Cover with 1 Pillow Sham - 2 Pieces Comforter Cover with Zipper Closure - Ultra Soft Brushed Microf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qcv6daUvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DUVET COVER SET - Includes a twin duvet cover measuring 68 by 90 inches with a zippered closure, 1 pillow case (shams) measuring 20 by 26 inches with a 2 inches flange which adds classic decorative accent to the pillow shams (COMFORTER SOLD SEPARATELY). SOFT BRUSHED MICROFIBER – Woven from brushed microfiber fabric, the duvet cover set is iron easy, wrinkle free, fade resistant and protects against any shrinkage after washing. Breathable & cool to touch, our duvet cover set will provide you with a restful sleep experience that will leave you feeling revitalized. DURABILITY - The high tensile strength makes the duvet cover set strong, and less likely to rip or tear. Our duvet cover set maintains brightness and shape to ensure an elegant look for your bedroom while keeping your temperature regulated. PERFECTLY SEWN CLOSURE - The hidden zipper closure of the duvet cover set facilitates inserting your duvet into the cover and keeps it secure without shifting or bunching up. Additionally, the duvet cover features four tie knots that keeps the comforter in place. WASHING INSTRUCTIONS – It is recommended to wash the duvet cover set with similar colored items for best results. Avoid washing it with dark colored items EASY CARE - Machine wash the duvet cover with like colors and tumble dry the duvet cover on low heat; (CLOSE ZIPPER COMPLETELY WHEN WASHING TO SECURE TIE KNOT)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qcv6daUvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Utopia Bedding","source_asin":"B00NVQIBO2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-260737","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NVQIBO2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NVQIBO2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
