window.products.push({"id":260744,"name":"Bread Box For Kitchen Countertop with 12 Pack Bread Bag & Bread Clip, HOUSALE Double Layer Bread Storage with Clear Windows, Extra Large Bread Contain","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KiDhlS4rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍞 EXTRA LARGE BREAD BOX WITH 12 PACK BREAD BAG & BREAD CLIP - On busy mornings, 12 bread bags worth $19.99 is more convenient and fast to carry, and a bread clip worth $9.99 will be more hygienic. There's no better way to store fresh bread than in a breadbox with Bread Bag & Bread Clip. 🥐 UPGRADED THICKENED DOUBLE-LAYER BAMBOO MATERIAL - Compared with other bamboo bread boxes, we use thickened double-layered bamboo 100% material, which is more Sturdiness. With the highest craftsmanship standard in the United States, it ensures that the bread can be stored more safely and fresh. 🥖 HUGE STORAGE CAPACITY & CLEAR TRANSPARENT WINDOW - Double-layer storage space, more storage space than single-layer and stainless steel bread boxes, 15-inch wide design, 10-inch extended depth style. A clear display window is built and allows for a clear inside view. Easily see how much bread you have left with our rustic large bread box for the kitchen countertop, preventing your bread inside from any unnecessary air. 🧀 SUPER MAGNETIC LOCK AND VENT KEEPS BREAD FRESH - Enhanced magnetism for better airtightness of the bread storage. Unlike airtight containers that quickly dry out and stale the bread, our bread saver box retains just enough moisture to keep most bread fresh for up to 4 or 5 full days. Bread clip holder on the side and heightened design on the bottom, better storage of bread clips, and your cutting board and knives at the bottom. 🥞 EASY TO ASSEMBLE & LIFETIME WARRANTY - Equipped with detailed installation instructions and dedicated customer service, a screwdriver is included in the package for easy assembly. If you have any problems with installation and products, please don't hesitate to contact us, our customer service manager will solve your problem immediately. At HOUSALEwe aim to add joy and simplicity to your everyday life with cooking accessories and utensils you will love!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KiDhlS4rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOUSALE","source_asin":"B09Q7Y7L6F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-260744","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q7Y7L6F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q7Y7L6F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
