window.products.push({"id":260775,"name":"Kidz World Disneys Fairies Kids Recliner , Multi-Colored","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v-tXFtPuL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Constructed with a mixed hardwood frame. Frame is generously padded with polyester fiber fill and densified fibers for comfort and safety. Contains a steel reclining mechanism manufactured in the USA. Horizontal stitch in the mid section of over stuffed backrest adds eye appeal and styling. Recommended ages: 3 to 7 years. Made from 50% wood, 15% densified fiber, 5% polyester fibers, 8% metal, 2% plastic and 20% fabric. Made in USA. No assembly required. Seat height: 13.5 in.. Weight limit: 75 lbs.. Overall: 24.5 in. W x 23 in. D in. x 28 in. H (32 lbs.). This adorable new addition to our line of Disney juvenile upholstered furniture is a childrens recliner featuring the Disney Fairies, including Tinkerbell and some of her other friends. The armrests are slightly wider at the top and then taper down to the floor with a flattened front surface. There is a coordinating purple plastic cup holder recessed into the top of the right armrest. The recliner is then upholstered in a 7 oz. all over fabric featuring flowers, butterflies and silhouettes of the Fairies. The seat is finished with a coordinating solid purple fabric, as is the fabric that is sewn to the front of the seat bottom to the footrest that is done with the all over fabric. This model also features a magazine pocket sewn onto the lower right outside of the armrest. The inner backrest is upholstered with the new state of he art sublimation printed polyester fabric featuring the Fairies in flight amidst a lilac background with the butterflies and floral pattern that coordinates with the all over pattern on the rest of the chair. This new printing process enables the images to resemble a real photograph with the multiple use of colors and shading and makes the figures look life like. The bottom of the recliner is covered in black upholstery fabric and there are round, plastic feet on each corner to avoid wear and tear of the fabric.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v-tXFtPuL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kidz World","source_asin":"B006B6XF7W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-260775","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006B6XF7W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006B6XF7W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
