window.products.push({"id":260915,"name":"WATERJOY Over The Toilet Storage Cabinet, Bathroom Cabinet Organizer with 2 Moru Tempered Glass Door, Space-Saving Toilet Shelf, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41YFP0Pit5L._AC_SL1166_.jpg","description":"【Upgrade Size & Space-saving】This over toilet storage cabinet is designed to help you take advantage of the large wall space over the toilet or washing machine. It is a necessary item for small bathrooms/apartments without taking up much floor space. It is a super practical and space-efficient solution to your bathroom storage. Moreover, the bottom shelf is 32 inch high from the ground so that it is capable of fitting over most standard toilets or washing machine. 【Storage Cabinet】This wood bathroom space saver with two door cabinets and open shelves for easy storage and easy access. If you want to store towels, toilet paper, soaps, shampoos, body wash in your restroom with limited space, you can consider over the toilet storage cabinet that run vertically instead of horizontally. This bathroom cabinet will be a good choice for you. It is suitable for bathroom, balcony, laundry and other places. 【Classic Design for Home Decor and Privacy Protection】The classic white finish and structure with frosted glass not only brings a modern and elegant Look to any Home but also do good privacy protection. It will match and accent any existing decor. It is also a perfect decoration to fit your bathroom and offer you a tidy and convenient life style. Coming with anti-toppling fitting to wall for added stability. 【Durable and Easy to Clean】This bathroom organizer is made of high-quality MDF for long-lasting use. Considering the special condition of bathroom, the surface is also finished with water-proof and moisture proof paint to add its durability and stability. It is easy to clean. Just wipe with a damp cleaning cloth to keep it clean. 【Easy assembly】This bath furniture cabinet arrives at your door as a flat pack with a well-illustrated user's guide and all fasteners in the package. Easy to assemble with the included step by step guide. All parts and accessories of the bathroom storage are easy to distinguish. Concise instruction enables you to take less time and energy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41YFP0Pit5L._AC_SL1166_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERJOY","source_asin":"B0BLGPP5GR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-260915","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLGPP5GR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLGPP5GR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
