window.products.push({"id":260991,"name":"Mail Organizer with Shelf Wall Mounted, Mail Holder for Wall Decorative, Wooden Key Holder Rack with Hooks, 2 Tier Wall Mail Organizer with 4 Key Hook","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CJhxzZvyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【MAIL ORGANIZER MAIL HOLDER】 - This farmhouse mail organizer wall mounted visible slat design to allow you get clear idea of inside papers and mails . Spacious room for the first up slot to hold up to 60 mails. The mail shelf below is perfect to storage letter, bill, newspaper. Comes with 4 key holders. It is the perfect place to keep all essentials neat and tidy in one spot - your one stop shop for everything important. Grab your keys & wallet and you’re ready to go. 【MINIMALIST WALL DECOR ORGANIZER】 - This wall mail and key holder is suitable for kinds of home decoration styles. The minimalist and unique design will add a touch of style to your storage and complement your home decor. Key holder for wall is made of raw wood materials and has good stability,enough to meet your storage problem.(Note:Wall key holder is made from a different batch of wood, so it has a certain color difference.) 【QUALITY KEY AND MAIL HOLDER FOR WALL】- Our mail holder for wall with 4 key hooks is made by excellent quality of 100% solid wood and sturdy bronze hooks. It is very durable and can be used for many years. Multipurpose wall mount organizer is perfect for an entryway, porch, yard, backyard, kitchen, bathroom, living room, bedroom, office, and more. 【EASY TO MOUNT WALL MAIL ORGANIZER】 - Just get out your screwdriver, we’ll deliver the rest! With the 2 nail hook, mounting this mail organizer key holder is a piece of cake. Perfect size: 11.3\"L x3.6\"W x16.6 \"H, Ideal for entryway space organizing and wall decorative. 【100% RISK-FREE GUARANTEE】- With a shelf for sunglasses or wallet and hooks for key, coats, leashes and hats, our key and mail holder for wall reduces entryway clutter. Created to make your home a more delightful place to be in, we're confident you'll love this mail key holder wall organizer. If you have any concerns, pls contact us and we will response within 24 hours !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CJhxzZvyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOLLASI","source_asin":"B08XWZDDYX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-260991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XWZDDYX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XWZDDYX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
